 "intro_html": "The simplest soba: noodles boiled, rubbed clean under cold water and chilled in ice water, then dipped into a cold soy–mirin–bonito sauce. A soba alternative to the rice-noodle stir-fries — for a hot day instead of the <a href=\"chicken-pad-thai.html\">pad thai</a>. The concentrated sauce keeps a month, so make it ahead.",
