    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 2,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": null,
   "time_html": null,
   "title": "Kombu and bonito",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-f=\"piece|pieces\" data-n=\"1\">1 piece</span>",
     "name_html": "Kombu"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"5\" data-b=\"10\">5–10 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Katsuobushi (bonito flakes)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bring it to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer for 5 minutes.</li><li>Turn off the heat and let it steep until it’s fully cool, then strain.</li><li>This is a <b>concentrate</b> — it gets diluted before serving.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-3",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Simmer, cool, strain",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Cool completely, then strain — it's a concentrate.",
      "src": "illustrations/zaru-soba/3-how1.webp?v=63f1e494f2"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/zaru-soba/3.webp?v=de4238cb1b",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 3,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "5 min + cooling",
   "time_html": "<span>5 min + cooling</span>",
   "title": "Simmer, cool, strain",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Bring a big pot of water to a boil — <b>no salt</b>.</li><li>Fan the soba in so the strands stay apart; stir now and then.</li><li>Cook for the packet time (usually 4–5 minutes), until just tender with a slight chew.</li><li>If it threatens to boil over, lower the heat — never add cold water.</li><li>Before draining, save <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"240\" data-b=\"360\" data-s=\"0\">240–360 ml</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1\" data-b=\"1.5\" data-s=\"0\" data-alt=\"1\">1–1½ cups</span>)</span> of the cooking water (sobayu) for the end.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "high",
    "label_html": "<span>high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Boil the soba",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "No salt. Fan the soba in so the strands stay apart.",
      "src": "illustrations/zaru-soba/4-how1.webp?v=fd07f78510"
     },
     {
      "caption": "Save 1–1½ cups of the cooking water (sobayu) before draining.",
      "src": "illustrations/zaru-soba/4-how2.webp?v=f0e637f246"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/zaru-soba/4.webp?v=7f44e49d9b",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 4,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~4–5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~4–5 min</span>",
   "title": "Boil the soba",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"400\">400 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"oz\" data-a=\"14\" data-alt=\"1\">14 oz</span>)</span> — <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"100\" data-s=\"0\">100 g</span> per serving",
     "name_html": "Dried soba"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Drain in a sieve and rinse under cold running water, <b>rubbing gently</b> with your hands until the water runs clear.</li><li>Don’t skip it — unrinsed soba clumps and turns slimy.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-5",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Rinse",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Rinse under cold running water, rubbing gently, until the water runs clear.",
      "src": "illustrations/zaru-soba/5-how1.webp?v=b8ba5cd17a"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/zaru-soba/5.webp?v=949b77a200",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 5,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "~1 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~1 min</span>",
   "title": "Rinse",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<p>Shake the sieve, tip the noodles into a big bowl of iced water for <b>30 seconds</b>, then drain well.</p>",
