  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the concentrate with the iced water — about <b>1 : 3</b>.</li><li>Taste: more water if it’s too salty, more concentrate if it’s weak.</li><li>Pour into small cups, one each.</li></ul>",
